{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24357","headline":"洛下闲居寄山南令狐相公 · 白居易","name":"洛下闲居寄山南令狐相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已收身向园林下，犹寄名於禄仕间。\n不锻嵇康弥嬾静，无金疎傅更贫闲。\n支分门内余生计，谢绝朝中旧往还。\n唯是相君忘未得，时思汉水梦巴山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}